{
  "title": "Transit Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 VPC와 사내망을 중앙 연결 지점에서 관리합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Transit Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#guide-1\">네트워크 연결과 경로 구성</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#guide-2\">통신 영역 분리하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>56 / 62</span></div><h1>Transit Gateway</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Transit Gateway는 <strong>여러 VPC와 사내 네트워크를 연결하는 네트워크 허브</strong>입니다. 각 네트워크를 서로 일일이 연결하는 대신 중심 지점에 연결해 관리할 수 있습니다.</p><p>네트워크 수가 많아지거나 운영·개발 환경의 통신 경계를 중앙에서 관리해야 할 때 유용합니다. 연결과 함께 Transit Gateway의 라우팅 테이블을 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"attachments\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"route-table-association\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"route-propagation\"></span><h2>네트워크 연결과 경로 구성</h2><p>VPC, VPN 등의 연결 대상을 어태치먼트<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>로 연결합니다. VPC 쪽 라우팅 테이블에도 다른 네트워크로 향하는 Transit Gateway 경로가 필요합니다.</p><p>어태치먼트를 어떤 Transit Gateway 라우팅 테이블에 연결할지 정하고, 해당 테이블이 어떤 목적지 경로를 가지는지 설정합니다. 경로 전파를 사용하면 연결 대상의 경로를 테이블에 반영할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"static-and-blackhole-routes\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"inter-region-peering\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aws-ram-sharing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"appliance-mode\"></span><h2>통신 영역 분리하기</h2><p>운영망과 개발망이 직접 통신하지 않도록 서로 다른 라우팅 테이블을 사용할 수 있습니다. 공통 서비스망은 필요한 영역과만 통신하도록 경로를 제공합니다.</p><p>다른 계정의 VPC를 연결할 때는 공유와 권한을, 다른 리전과 연결할 때는 Transit Gateway 피어링을 검토합니다. 각 연결의 주소 중복과 데이터 처리 비용도 고려합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>중앙 연결 구성 순서</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>네트워크 연결</strong><span>VPC·VPN 어태치먼트</span></li><li><strong>경로 테이블 구분</strong><span>운영·개발·공통 영역</span></li><li><strong>필요한 통신 제공</strong><span>상호 접근 범위 설정</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">허브에 연결하는 것과 모든 네트워크의 상호 통신을 허용하는 것은 별도 설정입니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>여러 계정의 VPC가 사내망과 공통 인증 서버에 접근하도록 구성합니다. Transit Gateway를 중심으로 연결하고 개발망에서 운영망으로 가는 경로는 제공하지 않습니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>어태치먼트</strong> — VPC나 VPN 같은 네트워크가 Transit Gateway에 연결되는 접점입니다. 연결의 종류와 상태, 연결할 라우팅 테이블을 관리합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/tgw/what-is-transit-gateway.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is AWS Transit Gateway for Amazon VPC? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q019/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q019\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q019\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q019</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q019/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">VPC A is peered with VPC B, and VPC B is peered with VPC C. Can A reach C through B using these peering connections?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if A's security group allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. VPC peering does not support transitive routing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if B has a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, by default</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a>은 비전이적이다. 별도 연결이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q020\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q020\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q020</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q020/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants a central hub to connect dozens of VPCs and on-premises networks. Which service is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q020\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q020\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q020\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q020\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>가 다수 네트워크의 중앙 연결과 라우팅에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q094\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q094\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q094</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">One VPC uses 10.0.0.0/16 and a VPC it must connect to uses 10.0.1.0/24. What prevents VPC peering between them?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The presence of route tables</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CIDR ranges overlap</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The VPCs are in different AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Each VPC has an ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 겹치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a> 연결에 사용할 수 없다. 주소 계획부터 바꿔야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q022\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q022\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q022</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q022/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to quickly establish an encrypted tunnel between its on-premises network and AWS over the internet. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Site-to-Site VPN</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>이 IPsec 터널을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q008\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">이전 용어 <b>Subnet / CIDR</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">다음 용어 <b>VPC</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
